{"page":173,"lines":[{"w":0.81742368425641743,"text":"Pray!-such is the traditional title of this Sunday. The word","y":0.93465495326944581,"h":0.023889717601594529,"x":0.075823684101567798,"conf":1},{"text":"of God speaks to us thus:","y":0.91567460324607686,"conf":1,"w":0.34679333575360183,"x":0.076009505282343987,"h":0.020371908233279279},{"x":0.073071447486497451,"w":0.50703856232878453,"y":0.88547988476587469,"h":0.026074084024580668,"text":"\"I dwell in the high and holy place,","conf":1},{"x":0.090094045502017356,"text":"and also with him who is of a contrite and humble spirit,","conf":1,"y":0.86186228215333149,"w":0.80796764423320822,"h":0.024962935182783363},{"conf":1,"x":0.090261289040131323,"w":0.47743467851118604,"h":0.021854236012413319,"text":"to revive the spirit of the humble,","y":0.84151785671430968},{"h":0.021911913440341046,"text":"and to revive the heart of the contrite\" (Isa. 57: 15).","conf":1,"x":0.090261305300086636,"y":0.81820436511487038,"w":0.7102137478915127},{"w":0.26603324691970626,"text":"So then let us pray:","y":0.79067460310072801,"x":0.076009507466512596,"h":0.020371908233279279,"conf":1},{"w":0.79146452073927043,"conf":1,"text":"\"Make me simple and sincere, inwardly detached, gentle","h":0.02630873331947936,"x":0.10422796714729506,"y":0.76447433184274916},{"text":"and calm, penetrated by Thy peace. Make me pure in heart,","conf":1,"x":0.07590680341319074,"y":0.74262652389422357,"h":0.023584585341196229,"w":0.82205878914176644},{"x":0.075741489431488965,"w":0.81997423048143259,"h":0.026190172112177335,"conf":1,"text":"that in spirit and in truth I may behold Thy luminous","y":0.71969116915955489},{"x":0.076009511311550107,"conf":1,"y":0.69912790725510843,"text":"clarity. May my heart soar upwards as an eagle soars, living","w":0.81947742808948865,"h":0.021854236012413431},{"text":"in Thee alone.\"","w":0.21852731085442878,"h":0.018924188046228307,"conf":1,"y":0.68023255836539454,"x":0.073634209062096709},{"h":0.021854236012413431,"y":0.65401785675064683,"conf":1,"text":"At the same time to-day is also the first academic service","w":0.78859854363775872,"x":0.10688836677969572},{"h":0.023255813689458948,"y":0.62936046495759612,"x":0.076009520300138009,"w":0.81710211023107771,"conf":1,"text":"of this term. Let us submit all that it brings, together with"},{"w":0.82185269640637681,"conf":1,"text":"the work which we shall be called on to do, to the sway of","h":0.021802325097341368,"y":0.60901162793098051,"x":0.076009522818189165},{"text":"this message of Jesus; namely that we are unworthy servants","y":0.58720930264855076,"h":0.020429586607312533,"w":0.82185269640637681,"conf":1,"x":0.073634213649543326},{"conf":1,"text":"who, in whatever we may accomplish, are only fulfilling our","y":0.56395348868779505,"w":0.82185269640637681,"h":0.020371908233279279,"x":0.073634211594911556},{"conf":1,"x":0.07363419732698992,"y":0.54215116307006239,"w":0.81947742808948865,"h":0.0203488365052239,"text":"obligations, and who in the spirit of patience are prepared"},{"h":0.020394979015229242,"conf":1,"w":0.82185269640637681,"text":"for whatever God may send or bestow. We are so much the","x":0.073634219374008728,"y":0.51884920642488264},{"y":0.49702380941824198,"w":0.81947742808948865,"h":0.020418050743284732,"text":"more determined to tread this path of self-surrender because","conf":1,"x":0.076009511311550107},{"h":0.021802325097341479,"w":0.82185269640637681,"y":0.47383720945350949,"text":"we are also thinking of our friends who have been torn away","x":0.073634211594911556,"conf":1},{"text":"from their work, whether as teachers or students, who are","conf":1,"x":0.073634214682797502,"y":0.4505813958633933,"w":0.8218526964063767,"h":0.021888842658391083},{"x":0.076009509035223924,"conf":1,"w":0.81947742808948854,"text":"now out there at the front and who have suffered and must","y":0.43303571473828295,"h":0.016121031746031744},{"x":0.076009505098238214,"y":0.40550595246046262,"conf":1,"w":0.81710211023107759,"text":"go on suffering unspeakable things. Whatever problems and","h":0.021825396825396748},{"x":0.076009511311550107,"h":0.020389211556268161,"y":0.38368055560622738,"text":"difficulties oppress us here are nothing as compared with the","conf":1,"w":0.81947742808948865},{"conf":1,"text":"cruel destiny which weighs on them. How could they stead-","x":0.073634213649543326,"y":0.36185515917847588,"h":0.018958793746100544,"w":0.82185269640637681},{"w":0.82422801426478798,"conf":1,"x":0.071258905961430474,"y":0.33720930229507928,"h":0.021917681845407655,"text":"fastly face this destiny if not in the spirit of straightforward"},{"conf":1,"y":0.31540697725874212,"h":0.021894610117352276,"w":0.82660328258167615,"x":0.071258937687784102,"text":"unquestioning self-surrender, which renounces every right"},{"text":"and claim and humbly and trustingly leaves it to God to","x":0.073488097223352561,"y":0.29141508209470868,"w":0.82214518955775673,"h":0.024708594594682998,"conf":1},{"text":"decide for what service He needs man and what fate He will","w":0.81947742808948854,"y":0.27470930198887755,"conf":1,"h":0.015988372621082103,"x":0.076009499929919233},{"conf":1,"text":"send man? And how could we maintain our inner spiritual","y":0.25000000032708469,"h":0.01889534791310632,"w":0.82185269640637681,"x":0.073634226516865811},{"conf":1,"x":0.073634226048592863,"w":0.82185269640637693,"y":0.22817460334155426,"h":0.018918419641161699,"text":"communion with them if we were not at one with them in the"},{"conf":1,"h":0.017609126984126977,"y":0.20634920588048766,"w":0.82185269640637681,"x":0.073634211594911556,"text":"determination to bow in calmness and trust to the will of God"},{"w":0.82422801426478809,"conf":1,"x":0.073634221697772034,"y":0.18023255852791142,"h":0.020412282338218124,"text":"our Creator? So linked with them in heart and mind let us say:"},{"text":"\"Lord, send what Thou willest,","conf":1,"w":0.44027288857992597,"y":0.14845609090029177,"x":0.26322479480608885,"h":0.026071281660170809},{"text":"Happy or painful;","conf":1,"w":0.2541567567106966,"x":0.28266034026104125,"y":0.13070436471382307,"h":0.021911914386446574},{"y":0.11185515896671938,"conf":1,"text":"I am content, since both","x":0.28266033391619377,"w":0.33966745649065283,"h":0.020412282338218124},{"w":0.33361320991020704,"conf":1,"h":0.026040639196123427,"x":0.2822117154536451,"y":0.088989215403841637,"text":"Flow from Thy hands.\""},{"y":0.069767441535873775,"h":0.015988372621082103,"text":"177","conf":1,"x":0.4513064129635288,"w":0.061757719361936858}],"w":7029,"h":11508}